        "q": "Can I earn income from funding rates?",
        "a": "Yes \u2014 this is called a funding rate arbitrage or carry trade. Traders who are short in a bullish market collect funding payments. Some traders take opposing positions in spot and futures markets to collect funding while remaining price-neutral. This is an advanced strategy that requires careful execution."
